Note on bundled atlas artwork:

The files under `src/simple_brain_plot/atlases/*.svg` and
`src/simple_brain_plot/data/region_descriptions.json` are derived from the
original MATLAB project "Simple-Brain-Plot"
(https://github.com/dutchconnectomelab/Simple-Brain-Plot) by Scholtens,
de Lange & van den Heuvel (2021), https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.5346593.
That upstream repository does not publish an explicit license file; it
requests that reuse be accompanied by the citation given in the README.
If you plan to redistribute this package (e.g., publish it on PyPI),
please confirm licensing terms directly with the upstream authors first.
